WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.940
When a medicine reaches patients, its safety story is only beginning.

2
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:09.780
Every day, new evidence appears across safety cases, medical literature

3
00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.840
and real-world healthcare data.

4
00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:16.400
The challenge isn't a lack of information, it's the sheer number of connections

5
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.120
a safety team has to investigate.

6
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.060
A signal may be buried across dozens of cases, publications and historical

7
00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:23.580
patterns.

8
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:27.980
Hygelis continuously connects permitted evidence to surface patterns that

9
00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:29.120
deserve a closer look.

10
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:33.540
And when a potential signal emerges, Hygelis doesn't stop at an alert.

11
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.540
It begins investigating the evidence behind it.

12
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:37.620
Hygelis.

13
00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:39.960
Find the signal. Protect the patient.
